This band is used as dedicated backhaul. You can disable Hide SSID to allow devices to connect.
The connection between your node and your uplink AiMesh device is weak. Please move your node and uplink AiMesh device closer to each other.
Your AiMesh node cannot connect to your uplink AiMesh device. Ensure that both devices have been powered on. If your node still fails to connect, power cycle your devices and move them closer to each other.
The connection between your node and your uplink AiMesh device can be improved. Please refer to the FAQ to improve your connection's quality.
