Powerline Master
In a Powerline mesh network, we need one of the powerline devices to work as a Powerline Master, which can be a AiMesh router or a AiMesh node with a solid backhaul network to allow another mesh node to connect with it using powerline backhaul. In default , the mesh system selects AiMesh router as Powerline Master. You can select another PLC capable node as Powerline Master if the PLC performance on AiMesh router is not good enough.
Threat Activities
Security Alert
Alert Preference
Please select the client name
AiProtection with Trend Micro provides real-time network monitoring to detect malware, viruses, and intrusions before they can reach your PC or device. Parental Controls let you schedule times that a connected device is able to access the Internet. You can also restrict unwanted websites and apps.
This feature prevents infected devices from being enslaved by botnets or zombie attacks which might steal your personal information or attack other devices.
