Bandwidth Tuning
Please enter the upload and download bandwidth of your internet connection.
ROG Rapture RT-AX53U will use this information to optimize traffic, for lag-free gaming.
Game Dashboard
Game Dashboard provides real-time information about all of your devices and connections, showing which devices are online and the applications they’re using.
Dashboard
Game Ports and Dedicated Gaming WiFi
Connect any gaming device to one of the two dedicated gaming LAN ports for optimized gaming. Once connected, your device is given priority over other traffic — so you’re always at the head of the internet queue!
You can also dedicate one of the 5GHz WiFi bands solely to gaming devices, to create your own gaming WiFi network. When one band is dedicated to gaming, all other devices will use the other 5GHz band or the 2.4GHz band!
Game Radar
Game Radar helps you find the best server for your game. It determines your location and Internet Service Provider (ISP), and then provides you with a map that shows available servers, so you can easily choose the best option.
All game names, logos and brands are property of their respective owners. Use of these names, logos, and brands does not imply endorsement.
Smooth VR Gaming and 4K Video Streaming
With the power of ROG Rapture RT-AX53U you can enjoy smooth, lag-free and exceptionally reliable online VR gaming and 4K video streaming!
Top Client
Are you sure you want to clear data?
Two-Way IPS
The Two-Way Intrusion Prevention System protects any device connected to the network from spam or DDoS attacks. It also blocks malicious incoming packets to protect your router from network vulnerability attacks, such as Shellshocked, Heartbleed, Bitcoin mining, and ransomware. Additionally, Two-Way IPS detects suspicious outgoing packets from infected devices and avoids botnet attacks.
Vulnerability Protection
This will enable Vulnerability Protection, Malicious Site Blocking and Infected Device Prevention and Blocking, and also switch all router configuration to security status. Security settings will impact your wireless, wired and attached storage network performance.
Resolves common exploits within the router configuration. Protects the system and applications from exploits and vulnerabilities with Trend Micro Virtual Patch.
