Please key in the username/password that your Internet Service Provider (ISP) has provided and click Next.
This item may be specified by some ISPs. Check with your ISP and fill them in if required.
Some Internet Service Providers block MAC addresses if the device makes DHCP queries too often. To prevent this, change the DHCP query frequency. <br/> In the default Aggressive mode, if RT-AX53U does not get a response from the ISP, it sends another query after 20 seconds and makes three more attempts.<br/>In Normal mode, if RT-AX53U does not get a response from the ISP, it makes a second query after 120 seconds and makes two more attempts.
