LED On/Off
The LED on/off control is used to turn off all LEDs includes Aura light.
To enable Aura RGB, LED must remain on. Please turn on LED by pressing hardware button on the router for 3 seconds or enable it via web/app interface.
Event
The system will detect the following events and trigger different LED effects.
When enabling Game Boost, you will see the LED bar use a red breathing effect.
Traffic Meter
The rainbow LED shows your real-time traffic and changes its color combination according to your current Internet speed.
Login Failure
When failing to log-in, you will see the LED bar use a red comet effect.
Attack Block
When the system successfully blocks a potential attack, you will see a LED bar use a red comet effect.
Note: After selecting Event, the system will show different LED effects based on the current detected event. You cannot control your device's LEDs while using this function.
