What is %@?
%@ is a cloud management tool that allows administrators to easily control and manage multiple network devices(sites) remotely without geographical limitations. It provides comprehensive network setups to fit the need for network management and allows more than two local networks to establish encrypted VPN connections to form a virtual network group. It addresses the needs of network security and multi-network management in business scenarios.
How to create site in %@?
%@ allows adding new sites by remote or local setups.
For more details, please refer to [aa]this FAQ[/aa].
